<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/images/ThePoolLab.png"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="https://www.maytronics.com/dw/image/v2/BGGP_PRD/on/demandware.static/-/Library-Sites-MaytronicsSharedLibrary/default/dw67795726/MTNA/Excci_Titan_Image_OnWhite%20673x850.jpg"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/d071dca61fbb01bf.css" crossorigin="" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/0fc6c400c3ed5371.css" crossorigin="" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-9104c05f1a1687bc.js" crossorigin=""/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/fd9d1056-4dbbcf07a05c3f48.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/472-6eced84fcf03e6a3.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/main-app-ce281d8555633725.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/413-e7f375c310822fe5.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/reviews/%5Bsku%5D/page-158ca34b840e43ec.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/975-95592eb349967368.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-4ee2f436a51b65f2.js" async=""></script><title>Dolphin Nautilus Titan Review - The Pool Lab</title><meta name="description" content="The newest evolution of the Nautilus line, featuring Wi-Fi connectivity and enhanced agility."/><link rel="canonical" href="https://www.the-pool-lab.com/reviews/Dolphin-Nautilus-Titan"/><meta property="og:title" content="Dolphin Nautilus Titan Review"/><meta property="og:description" content="The newest evolution of the Nautilus line, featuring Wi-Fi connectivity and enhanced agility."/><meta property="og:image" content="https://www.maytronics.com/dw/image/v2/BGGP_PRD/on/demandware.static/-/Library-Sites-MaytronicsSharedLibrary/default/dw67795726/MTNA/Excci_Titan_Image_OnWhite%20673x850.jpg"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="The Pool Lab - Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips."/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.the-pool-lab.com/images/ThePoolLabOG.png"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-c67a75d1b6f99dc8.js" crossorigin="" noModule=""></script></head><body class="d-flex flex-column min-vh-100"><nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-light bg-light"><div class="container"><a class="navbar-brand d-flex align-items-center" href="/"><div style="width:160px;height:90px;position:relative;margin-right:10px"><img src="/images/ThePoolLab.png" alt="The Pool Lab Logo" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><span class="d-none d-sm-inline">The Pool Lab</span></a><button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarNav"><span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span></button><div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarNav"><ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto"><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/">Home</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/reviews">Reviews</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/best-of">Best of</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/guides">Guides</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about">About</a></li></ul></div></div></nav><main class="flex-grow-1"><div class="container my-5"><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-8"><h1 class="mb-3">Dolphin Nautilus Titan<!-- -->: In-Depth Review</h1><div class="text-center mb-4 p-3 bg-white rounded border" style="height:400px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><img src="https://www.maytronics.com/dw/image/v2/BGGP_PRD/on/demandware.static/-/Library-Sites-MaytronicsSharedLibrary/default/dw67795726/MTNA/Excci_Titan_Image_OnWhite%20673x850.jpg" alt="Dolphin Nautilus Titan" class="img-fluid" style="max-height:100%;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain;width:auto;height:auto"/></div><p class="lead">The Dolphin Nautilus Titan is the next-generation successor to the legendary Nautilus series. It takes everything people loved about the CC Plus—reliability, scrubbing power, and simplicity—and drags it into the modern era with Wi-Fi connectivity and a lighter, more agile body. It represents the new standard for mid-range robotic pool cleaners.</p><h3 class="mt-5">Who This Is For</h3><div><p>The Titan is the perfect upgrade for:</p><ul><li><strong>Tech-forward owners</strong> who want to control their cleaner from the MyDolphin Plus app.</li><li>Those who want a <strong>lighter robot</strong> that is easier to lift (it's significantly lighter than the CC Plus).</li><li>Pools with <strong>vertical tile lines</strong> that need aggressive scrubbing.</li><li>Anyone who wants the latest and greatest technology.</li></ul></div><h3 class="mt-5">Who Should Skip It</h3><div><p>You might stick with the CC Plus if:</p><ul><li><strong>You don't care about apps:</strong> If you just want to push a button, the CC Plus is cheaper and just as effective.</li><li><strong>You have a weak Wi-Fi signal:</strong> The smart features require a good connection at the pool pad.</li></ul></div><h3 class="mt-5">Key Features</h3><div><ul><li><strong>Wi-Fi Connectivity:</strong> Control and schedule from anywhere with the MyDolphin Plus app.</li><li><strong>Lightweight Design:</strong> Ergonomic build makes it easy to lift and handle.</li><li><strong>PowerStream Mobility:</strong> Enhanced navigation for better wall and waterline coverage.</li><li><strong>Top-Load Basket:</strong> Large capacity filter basket for easy maintenance.</li><li><strong>Quick Water Release:</strong> Drains rapidly upon removal from the pool.</li></ul></div><h3 class="mt-5">Detailed Analysis</h3><div><p><strong>Smart Connectivity:</strong> The biggest headline is the addition of Wi-Fi. Unlike the CC Plus, the Titan connects to the MyDolphin Plus app. This allows you to schedule cleanings, check the robot's status, and even steer it manually (on some models) right from your phone. It brings the convenience of the high-end Sigma to a more affordable price point.</p><p><strong>Enhanced Agility:</strong> The Titan features a redesigned body that is lighter and more hydrodynamic. This allows it to move faster and climb walls with less effort. The water release system has also been improved, so when you pull it out, the water dumps instantly, saving your back.</p><p><strong>Filtration:</strong> It retains the excellent top-load basket design but with a slightly larger capacity. The basket is easy to rinse and comes with fine filters standard, ensuring your water stays polished.</p></div><div class="row mt-4"><div class="col-md-6"><div class="card border-success h-100"><div class="card-header bg-success text-white">Pros</div><ul class="list-group list-group-flush"><li class="list-group-item">Wi-Fi app control is a major upgrade over the CC Plus</li><li class="list-group-item">Lighter and easier to handle than older models</li><li class="list-group-item">Excellent waterline scrubbing performance</li><li class="list-group-item">Modern, sleek design</li><li class="list-group-item">Energy efficient operation</li></ul></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="card border-danger h-100"><div class="card-header bg-danger text-white">Cons</div><ul class="list-group list-group-flush"><li class="list-group-item">More expensive than the standard Nautilus CC Plus</li><li class="list-group-item">Requires a strong Wi-Fi signal to use smart features</li><li class="list-group-item">No swivel on the cable (still!)</li><li class="list-group-item">Caddy is sold separately</li></ul></div></div></div><h3 class="mt-5">Final Verdict</h3><p>The Dolphin Nautilus Titan is a worthy successor to the throne. It successfully modernizes the Nautilus line without losing the core reliability that made it famous. If you&#x27;ve been waiting for a Nautilus with an app, this is it. While it costs a bit more than the classic CC Plus, the added convenience of Wi-Fi and the lighter weight make it a compelling upgrade for the modern pool owner.</p></div><div class="col-lg-4"><div class="card sticky-top" style="top:20px"><div class="card-body text-center"><h5 class="card-title">Dolphin Nautilus Titan</h5><p class="card-text">Ready to buy? Get the best price online.</p><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XFCQJPH?tag=scorpiusllc-20" target="_blank" class="btn btn-warning btn-lg fw-bold w-100 ">Check Price on Amazon</a><small class="text-muted d-block mt-2">We may earn a commission on qualifying purchases.</small></div><div class="card mt-4"><div class="card-header bg-light fw-bold">Consider These Alternatives</div><ul class="list-group list-group-flush"><li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center"><a class="text-decoration-none fw-bold" href="/reviews/Dolphin-Nautilus-CC-Plus">Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus</a><span class="badge bg-secondary rounded-pill">$<!-- -->799</span></li><li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center"><a class="text-decoration-none fw-bold" href="/reviews/Polaris-9650iQ-Sport">Polaris 9650iQ Sport</a><span class="badge bg-secondary rounded-pill">$<!-- -->1099</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></main><footer class="bg-dark text-white text-center py-3 mt-auto"><div class="container"><p class="mb-1">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->The Pool Lab<!-- -->. All rights reserved.</p><small class="text-white-50">The Pool Lab<!-- --> is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com.</small></div></footer><script src="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-9104c05f1a1687bc.js" crossorigin="" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0]);self.__next_f.push([2,null])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:HL[\"/_next/static/css/d071dca61fbb01bf.css\",\"style\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}]\n2:HL[\"/_next/static/css/0fc6c400c3ed5371.css\",\"style\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}]\n0:\"$L3\"\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"4:I[3728,[],\"\"]\n6:I[9928,[],\"\"]\n7:I[8326,[\"326\",\"static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js\",\"413\",\"static/chunks/413-e7f375c310822fe5.js\",\"183\",\"static/chunks/app/reviews/%5Bsku%5D/page-158ca34b840e43ec.js\"],\"\"]\n8:I[6954,[],\"\"]\n9:I[7264,[],\"\"]\nb:I[7625,[\"326\",\"static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js\",\"975\",\"static/chunks/975-95592eb349967368.js\",\"185\",\"static/chunks/app/layout-4ee2f436a51b65f2.js\"],\"\"]\nc:I[6507,[\"326\",\"static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js\",\"975\",\"static/chunks/975-95592eb349967368.js\",\"185\",\"sta"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"tic/chunks/app/layout-4ee2f436a51b65f2.js\"],\"\"]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"3:[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/css/d071dca61fbb01bf.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"1\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/css/0fc6c400c3ed5371.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}]],[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"buildId\":\"djvMwW8oavAnGg-5KPmVb\",\"assetPrefix\":\"\",\"initialCanonicalUrl\":\"/reviews/Dolphin-Nautilus-Titan\",\"initialTree\":[\"\",{\"children\":[\"reviews\",{\"children\":[[\"sku\",\"Dolphin-Nautilus-Titan\",\"d\"],{\"children\":[\"__PAGE__?{\\\"sku\\\":\\\"Dolphin-Nautilus-Titan\\\"}\",{}]}]}]},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",true],\"initialHead\":[false,\"$L5\"],\"globalErrorComponent\":\"$6\",\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"html\",null,{\"lang\":\"en\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"body\",nu