u003eTop-Load Basket:\u003c/strong\u003e Large capacity filter basket for easy maintenance.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Water Release:\u003c/strong\u003e Drains rapidly upon removal from the pool.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"}}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5\",\"children\":\"Detailed Analysis\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmart Connectivity:\u003c/strong\u003e The biggest headline is the addition of Wi-Fi. Unlike the CC Plus, the Titan connects to the MyDolphin Plus app. This allows you to schedule cleanings, check the robot's status, and even steer it manually (on some models) right from your phone. It brings the convenience of the high-end Sigma to a more affordable price point.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEnhanced Agility:\u003c/strong\u003e The Titan features a redesigned body that is lighter and more hydrodynamic. This allows it to move faster and climb walls with less effort. The water release system has also been improved, so when you pull it out, the water dumps instantly, saving your back.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFiltration:\u003c/strong\u003e It retains the excellent top-load basket design but with a slightly larger capacity. The basket is easy to rinse and comes with fine filters standard, ensuring your water stays polished.\u003c/p\u003e\"}}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"row mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-md-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card border-success h-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-header bg-success text-white\",\"children\":\"Pros\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-group list-group-flush\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Wi-Fi app control is a major upgrade over the CC Plus\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Lighter and easier to handle than older models\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Excellent waterline scrubbing performance\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Modern, sleek design\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Energy efficient operation\"}]]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-md-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card border-danger h-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-header bg-danger text-white\",\"children\":\"Cons\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-group list-group-flush\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"More expensive than the standard Nautilus CC Plus\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Requires a strong Wi-Fi signal to use smart features\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"No swivel on the cable (still!)\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Caddy is sold separately\"}]]}]]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5\",\"children\":\"Final Verdict\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The Dolphin Nautilus Titan is a worthy successor to the throne. It successfully modernizes the Nautilus line without losing the core reliability that made it famous. If you've been waiting for a Nautilus with an app, this is it. While it costs a bit more than the classic CC Plus, the added convenience of Wi-Fi and the lighter weight make it a compelling upgrade for the modern pool owner.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-lg-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card sticky-top\",\"style\":{\"top\":\"20px\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-body text-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h5\",null,{\"className\":\"card-title\",\"children\":\"Dolphin Nautilus Titan\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"card-text\",\"children\":\"Ready to buy? Get the best price online.\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XFCQJPH?tag=scorpiusllc-20\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"className\":\"btn btn-warning btn-lg fw-bold w-100 \",\"children\":\"Check Price on Amazon\"}],[\"$\",\"small\",null,{\"className\":\"text-muted d-block mt-2\",\"children\":\"We may earn a commission on qualifying purchases.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-header bg-light fw-bold\",\"children\":\"Consider These Alternatives\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-group list-group-flush\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"Dolphin-Nautilus-CC-Plus\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L7\",null,{\"href\":\"/reviews/Dolphin-Nautilus-CC-Plus\",\"className\":\"text-decoration-none fw-bold\",\"children\":\"Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"badge bg-secondary rounded-pill\",\"children\":[\"$$\",799]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"Polaris-9650iQ-Sport\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L7\",null,{\"href\":\"/reviews/Polaris-9650iQ-Sport\",\"className\":\"text-decoration-none fw-bold\",\"children\":\"Polaris 9650iQ Sport\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"badge bg-secondary rounded-pill\",\"children\":[\"$$\",1099]}]]}]]}]]}]]}]}]]}]}],null],\"segment\":\"__PAGE__?{\\\"sku\\\":\\\"Dolphin-Nautilus-Titan\\\"}\"},\"styles\":null}],\"segment\":[\"sku\",\"Dolphin-Nautilus-Titan\",\"d\"]},\"styles\":null}],null],\"segment\":\"reviews\"},\"styles\":null}]}],[\"$\",\"footer\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-dark text-white text-center py-3 mt-auto\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"container\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-1\",\"children\":[\"© \",2026,\" \",\"The Pool Lab\",\". All rights reserved.\